  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.2.16 - Fork 2.3.5: SpawnDev.ILGPU.Algorithms.Fork 2.3.4 shipped WITHOUT the CUDA/PTX XMath.RoundToEven fix (1.5 rounded to 1) - the fix had been made in the T4-generated RoundingModes.cs, and the clean release build regenerated it from the unfixed RoundingModes.tt. Fixed in the template. Everything else as 5.2.15: WebGL loops compile in seconds and no longer stop at 100000 iterations; Autolykos2 dataset generation on WebGL; real C# struct layout on WebGL, WebGPU and Wasm; sub-word SubViews at a non-4-byte offset. See CHANGELOG.md.",
